LangString HeiranAssociationHrnDescription ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Open .hrn session files with Heiran. No other application uses this extension."
LangString HeiranAssociationImageName ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Common images"
LangString HeiranAssociationImageDescription ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Offer Heiran in Open with for PNG, JPEG, BMP, GIF, WebP, AVIF, JPEG XL, PSD and TIFF. The current default application is not changed."
LangString HeiranAssociationHdrName ${LANG_ENGLISH} "High precision"
LangString HeiranAssociationHdrDescription ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Offer Heiran in Open with for EXR, HDR, DPX and TGA. The current default application is not changed."
LangString HeiranAssociationsTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "File associations"
LangString HeiranAssociationsSubtitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose which file types to open with Heiran."
LangString HeiranAssociationsIntro ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Expand a category to choose individual file extensions. All supported image formats can be opened regardless of these choices."
